---
title: Whipped Cream
yield: 2%cups
tags:
  - ingredient
source:
  name: Serious Eats
  url: https://www.seriouseats.com/the-best-ways-to-make-whipped-cream-recipe-6755273
---

Chill a #metal bowl{} in the freezer, and prep a #hand mixer{} with a whisk attachment.

Add @granulated sugar{1%tsp}, @vanilla extract{1%tsp}, a little @salt{} to the bowl.

Add @heavy cream{1%cup} to the bowl.

Mix on low to medium for ~{30%seconds} to dissolve the sugar.

Switch to medium-high speed and continue whisking until stiff peaks form (1 to 2 minutes).

> Store in the refrigerator until ready to use, it will hold its shape for at least overnight.



